          "filename": "Infers Group Arting Health 2018 Science Communication Sexual Health HIV funded by the welcome trust 6045x4797.jpg",
          "caption": "The red figure represents the virus in its final form as AIDS,\nwhile the small green figures around it represent the different\nways the virus mutates.\nThe warrior figure represents Batswana activists, depicted in\ntraditional warrior attire and holding a spear covered by a\ncondom to show the role condoms play in the fight against the\ndisease.\nThe pills represents ARVs, which are also participating in the\nbattle. The smoke coming from the virus’s horns and spreading\nacross the artwork show that the virus is everywhere, spreading\n\nquickly.",
